meta {
  name: 02_DelegationRequestForPackage
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: A service owner asks a person to grant another person a package

    Given the valid party URN prefixes for delegation requests
    When the service owner creates a delegation request for the package
    And creating the same request again returns the same draft
    Then the request status is Draft
    When the service owner withdraws the request
    Then the request status is Withdrawn

  Requests cannot be deleted, so the scenario withdraws what it created. A draft left
  behind by a crashed run is picked up again by the create step and withdrawn.
}
